TEXT 576 -328 Left 2 !.param GfcV=20 ; magnitude at crossover *\n.param PSV=-90 ; phase lag at crossover *\n*\n* Enter Design Goals Information Here *\n*\n.param fcV=20 ; targeted crossover *\n.param PMV=60 ; choose phase margin at crossover *\n*\n* Enter the Values for Vout and Bridge Bias Current *\n*\n.param Vout=400\n.param Pout=10k ; nominal is 5 kW\n.param RL={(Vout)^2/(Pout)}\n.param Ibias=100u\n.param Vref=2.5\n.param Rlower={Vref/Ibias}\n.param Rupper={(Vout-Vref)/Ibias}\n*\n* Do not edit the below lines *\n .param boostV={PMV-PSV-90}\n .param GV={10**(-GfcV/20)}\n .param kV={tan((boostV/2+45)*pi/180)}\n .param fpV={fcV*kV}\n .param fzV={fcV/kV}\n .param C2V={1/(2*pi*fcV*GV*kV*Rupper)}\n .param C1V={C2V*(kV**2-1)}\n .param R2V={kV/(C1V*2*pi*fcV)}\n* .param C2V=10n\n* .param C1V=100p\n* .param R2V=10k\n*
